\**Optional**: Activate the {p:Records of Eminence} 15th Vana'versary IV objective __Miratete 1__ or __Miratete 1 (W)__ for for progress toward the {i:Omega Mount}, as well as sparks and experience.
=2 Walkthrough
Talk to Rouva on the West side of Victory Square (I-8) to begin the quest. She will ask you to bring her a sprig of {k:Rivernewort}.
* The Rivernewort key item can be found at a ??? located in either {p:Riverne - Site #B01|Riverne - Site B01} or {p:Riverne - Site #A01|Riverne - Site A01}. To get to either you will require {i:Giant Scale(s)|Giant Scale|1691}, or the Home Point Warps, to teleport through the Unstable Displacements.
** Riverne - Site #A01: The ??? is found on the island at (E-8) containing the zone to {z:Monarch Linn}. Two Giant Scales are required. (The Home Point warp places you at (I-9)).
** Riverne - Site #B01: The ??? is found on the island at (E-7), just before the final Stable Displacement heading towards {z:Monarch Linn} island. One Giant Scale, or the Home Point warp, is required.
* Once you have acquired the Rivernewort, return to Rouva for your reward; a {i:Page from Miratete's Memoirs|Miratete's Mem.|4247}.

=4 Additional Information
* Like other Experience Points scroll quests, it can be completed once per Conquest tally.

]=],
